wildos-remote (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First release: saved desktop and SSH hosts, Remote Desktop sessions on
    the Windows mode engine, an SSH terminal with snippets and suggestions,
    SFTP file copying, a keychain for SSH keys and host identity checks.

